## 10. Acceptance checklist

- [ ] `tool_registry.py` built generically; both model providers support tool-calling through it.
- [ ] `chat-with-doc` answers questions grounded in an attached file's content.
- [ ] `create-doc` generates a real `.docx`, stores it, and links it to the originating chat message.
- [ ] Disambiguation logic correctly avoids/invokes the tool per §4 examples.
- [ ] Split-pane UI opens on Preview/Edit, Quill editor loads/saves doc content, Download works.
- [ ] Close-without-saving shows the confirmation popup.
- [ ] Files auto-expire after 24h; expired preview/download attempts show the correct frontend message.
- [ ] Nothing written into `Current_IPRUGPT_Backend`; no other existing page affected.
- [ ] `STORAGE_BACKEND` env flag (`local` | `gcs`) fully controls which storage implementation is used, with no code changes needed to switch.
